{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"2":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)"},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":566,"arabicnumber":566,"text":"حدثنا سليمان بن حرب، حدثنا حماد، عن ايوب، عن نافع، عن ابن عمر، قال قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم \" لا تمنعوا اماء الله مساجد الله","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (900) Sahih Muslim (442)"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":176}}]}